🔑 Important Formulas

Min-Max Normalization

\[
X'=\frac{X-X_{min}}{X_{max}-X_{min}}
\]

Z-Score Standardization

\[
Z=\frac{X-\mu}{\sigma}
\]

BMI Feature

\[
BMI=\frac{Weight}{Height^2}
\]

Normal Distribution Rule

\[
1\sigma \approx 68\%,\quad
2\sigma \approx 95\%,\quad
3\sigma \approx 99.7\%
\]

Point Estimate

\[
\bar{x}=\frac{\sum x_i}{n}
\]

